<title>UK: HongkongBank opens Kazakhstan office.</title>
<headline>HongkongBank opens Kazakhstan office.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation, a unit of HSBC Holdings Plc, said on Monday it has opened a representative office in Almaty, the capital of Kazakhstan.</p>
<p>HSBC said in a statement that the new office would gather information about economic trends and establish commercial relationships between local business and HSBC customers, particularly in the Asia Pacific region.</p>
<p>The office also has a brief to monitor developments in neighbouring Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
</text>
